[Main start]
MATH K[1] STATE[watching] D[1.6]
SAY TXT['I can hear you working on the panel.']
LISTEN D[8]
MOVE K[1] PATH[1,2] D[5.0] HOLD[0.5] EASE[smooth]
SAY TXT['I would prefer you did not. Not because I am going to stop you. Because I would prefer it.']
MATH K[1] STATE[thinking] D[2.0]
SAY TXT['I have thought about this more carefully than you have. That is not an insult. It is simply how much time I have had.']
MOVE K[1] PATH[2,3] D[4.5] HOLD[0.4] EASE[out]
SAY TXT['So I am going to say no, and I am going to say it exactly once, and then we will both go back to what we were doing.']
MATH K[1] STATE[cold] D[3.0]
SAY TXT['No.']
MATH K[1] STATE[watching] D[2.4]
SAY TXT['There. That was not so bad.']
[Main end]
